flowchart LR
    subgraph Disk[System Device]
        subgraph Windows[Windows OS / User Data]
            R[Current SplitOS Release N+1]
            U[Live user.db / user files]
        end
        subgraph WinRE[Windows RE Tools Partition]
            W[Windows RE + SplitOS Recovery Tool]
        end
        subgraph Store[Hidden SplitOS Recovery Store]
            C[Verified Capsule of Release N]
        end
    end

    R -->|failure| X[Recovery Coordination]
    X -->|live path| C
    X -->|offline path| W
    W --> C
    C --> Y[Restore SplitOS release payload + machine state]
    Y --> Z[Boot Windows + verify previous SplitOS release]
    U -. preserved; not rolled back .-> Z
